{"pull": {"id": "number:23464", "number": 23464, "title": "KAFKA-21096: Deregister SharePartition metrics on teardown to fix leak", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2026-09-14T21:57:28Z", "closed_at": "2026-09-15T08:43:17Z", "merged_at": "2026-09-15T08:43:17Z", "user": {"login": "apoorvmittal10", "id": 2861565, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjE1NjU=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2861565?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10", "html_url": "https://github.com/apoorvmittal10", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "SharePartition registers Yammer gauges (InFlightMessageCount,\nInFlightBatchCount, etc.) whose suppliers capture the SharePartition\ninstance. These gauges were never deregistered when a partition was\nremoved from the cache, so the metrics registry kept a strong reference\nto every fenced SharePartition (and its cachedState) for the lifetime of\nthe broker.\n\nMake SharePartition implement AutoCloseable and deregister its metrics\nin close() via SharePartitionMetrics\n\nVerified against a live heap dump: after the fix there are zero live\nSharePartition and AcquisitionLockTimerTask instances; the only\nremaining SharePartition$$Lambda is a non-capturing per-call-site\nsingleton (zero captured fields) bound to the class, not to any\ninstance.\n\nReviewers: Andrew Schofield <aschofield@confluent.io>, Abhinav Dixit <adixit@confluent.io>, Omnia Ibrahim <o.g.h.ibrahim@gmail.com>\n", "labels": [{"id": 838330122, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MzgzMzAxMjI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/core", "name": "core", "color": "ed5a86", "default": false, "description": "Kafka Broker", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 6979675393, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABoAVlAQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/KIP-932", "name": "KIP-932", "color": "DA462F", "default": false, "description": "Queues for Kafka", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7522931565, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwGbTbQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/ci-approved", "name": "ci-approved", "color": "ffffff", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7559660738, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwpdEwg", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/small", "name": "small", "color": "FEF2C0", "default": false, "description": "Small PRs", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23464"}, "reviews": [], "review_comments": [], "issue_comments": [], "commits": [], "files": [], "timeline": [], "_partial": "search", "_source": "extra-data/github-search/author_apoorvmittal10_is_pr.json"}